    "media:imagetext": "B\nWE SUGGEST THAT WHILE SEATED YOU\nKEEP YOUR SEAT BELT FASTENED\n727-214\nIMPORTANT INFORMATION\nFOR OUR 727-214 FANJET PASSENGERS\nEMERGENCY EXITS\nThere are nine exits provided for your use. The chart below will\nshow you the one closest to your seat. The exits over the wings\nare removable windows. The two exits forward and the two side\nexits aft are doors which are equipped with fast operating\nevacuation slides.\nFWD CABIN DOORS\nFWD\nENTRY\nDOOR (LH Side)\nAND\nFWD\nGALLEY\nDOOR (RH Side)\nROTATE\nHANDLE\nCLOSED\nOPEN\nPUSH\nDOOR\nOUT\nSLIDE\nSTEP 1\nWINDOW EXITS\nSTEP 2\nPULL\nDOWN\nTHIS\nFLAP\nGRASP\nHANDLE\nAND\nPULL\nDOWN\nPULL\nTOP\nINWARD\nAND\nLIFT\nAFT SERVICE DOORS\nAFT\nSERVICE\nDOOR\n(LH and RH Side)\nPULL\nOUT\nHANDLE\nAND\nROTATE 180°\nPUSH i\nDOOR\nOUT\nOPEN\nLOSED\nSLIDE\nEMERGENCY EXITS\nENTRY\nDOOR\nAND\nESCAPE\nSLIDE\nSERVICE\nDOOR\n→ AND\nTESCAPE\nSLIDE\nWINDOW\nEXITS\nWINDOW\nEXITS\nSERVICE\nDOOR\nMAND Y\nESCAPE\nSLIDE\nSERVICE\nDOOR\nAND\nTESCAPE\nSLIDE\nMAIN\nREAR\nCABIN\nDOOR\nC\nPLACARDS GIVING STEPS\nFOR OPERATION OF EVA-\nCUATION SLIDE ARE LO-\nCATED ON EACH DOOR.\nSLIDE IS SHOWN READY\nFOR USE.\nPLEASE DO NOT REMOVE FROM AIRCRAFT\n2005.133.338\nSee Reverse Side",
